  "rationale": "Use a small sensor plant plus a motion-command plant, then encode the exploration and obstacle-recovery policy in deterministic specifications. The policy gives random_walk in clear exploration, inserts a short move_forward phase after clear sensing for coverage, and forces one-shot turn recovery after any obstacle event. Action states self-loop on path_clear and only obstacle events preempt them, matching open-loop pulse semantics.",
